Outputting an object can be very useful in scenarios where you need to generate a JSON or YAML
payload. You can reference this payload in another resource or output it so another tool can extract
that value from Terraform using the terraform output command.
Converting a list to a map
One common problem is converting a list into a map. This is needed because, while a list is sometimes
the most concise way of storing a simple collection, it cannot be used with the for_each iterator.
